  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be maintained in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:\r\rLocation Plan - p4f/uk/1322895/1773546\rBlock Plan - SC / 25 / 526 - 001\rExisting Floor Plans-  SC / 25 / 526 - 201 Rev. A\rPre-existing Elevations - SC / 25 / 526 - 102\r\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 5 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "No independent cooking or laundry facilities shall be installed in any of the respective bedrooms and the communal kitchen/living room shall be retained in perpetuity.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within 2 months of this permission, details of refuse storage facilities including facilities for the recycling of waste to be provided within the development, together with details of bin collection access in accordance with the Enfield Household Recycling and Waste Planning Guidance for New Developments, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The facilities shall be provided in accordance with the approved details before the development is occupied or use commences and maintained as such thereafter.\r\rReason: In the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support \rof the Boroughs waste reduction targets.\r"
  ],
